<title>BELGIUM: EU commission to present beet sowing estimates.</title>
<headline>EU commission to present beet sowing estimates.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission is due to present 1997/98 beet sowing estimates for the European Union 15 at the weekly sugar management committee on Wednesday, an EU member state official said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The Commission has said it will present an estimate but it will not be final,&quot; the official said.</p>
</text>
